        "text": "**B**\n\nTaking the money would mean deliberately harming someone who hasn't wronged me, just to ease my own hardship. The owner would lose money they were counting on, and the fact that I'd never be caught doesn't change what I'd be doing. I'd also be the one who had to live with it. I'd rather struggle through months of strict budgeting, and seek help like a payment plan or assistance program if I needed it.",
